{"title":"After Ten Years of Chopping Wood, Immortals Begged To Become My Disciples","synopsis":"Bai Luochen adalah seorang reinkarnasi yang berasal dari bumi saat masih muda dia menjadi siswa kelas atas karena tampil di acara pertunjukan bakat tapi dikarenaka dia menolak perintah agensinya dia dikucilkan dan akhirnya mati karena depresi dia terlahir kembali menjadi seorang instruktur di Akademi Qinghong yang tidak memiliki murid selama sepuluh tahun dikarena kultivasinya rendah dia mendapatkan system cheat memotong kayu bakar dimana dia hanya diberi tugas untuk memotong kayu bakar saja yang menurutnya tidak berguna secara tibatiba di acara perekrutan murid baru seorang gadis memintainya untuk menjadi gurunya yang dimana gadis ini adalah seorang reinkarnasi dari seorang immortal","alternative_title":"After Chopping Wood for 10 Years, All the Immortals Want to Become My Disciple","author":"BOOM工作室","artist":"BOOM工作室","genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy","Martial Arts","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"55a7dd37-8322-4ade-9461-ace5dcc4ed4d","number":"102","title":"Chapter 102","date":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"id":"d0ea7699-9c5d-40ec-ab73-d7ff0aff3a98","number":"101","title":"Chapter 101","date":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"id":"93c09b6e-0c49-4ebc-a2be-cb1bf3020373","number":"100","title":"Chapter 100","date":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"id":"e89d6d91-3d4d-430c-b947-e562930dfa19","number":"99","title":"Chapter 99","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"id":"0595c0a4-af69-4dce-88e0-71848932da35","number":"98","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"id":"d9b23176-3603-46a9-9fa2-310759e3f880","number":"97","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"id":"85bcc0de-a7e7-4a19-9b09-d0159ecb6339","number":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"id":"c7b8e42a-7883-4106-8dab-07fdf885cd5c","number":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"id":"f8ad2f7a-4de6-4f77-991f-b0eb4168bfda","number":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date